#. Description of the 'Enforce WMS-Only Stock Movements' (Check) field in
#. DocType 'WMS Settings'
#: frappe_wms/wms_core/doctype/wms_settings/wms_settings.json
msgid ""
"When enabled, WMS-managed warehouses (any ERPNext Warehouse linked from a"
" WMS Warehouse) cannot receive direct Stock Entry, Delivery Note, "
"Purchase Receipt, or Stock Reconciliation postings from ERPNext's own "
"desk. All stock movement must go through frappe_wms (Goods Receipt / "
"Goods Issue / RF app), which mirrors it into ERPNext automatically. Turn "
"this off only as a temporary escape hatch."
msgstr ""
"Cuando está activado, los almacenes gestionados por WMS (cualquier "
"almacén de ERPNext vinculado desde un almacén WMS) no pueden recibir "
"contabilizaciones directas de entrada de existencias, albarán, recepción "
"de compra o conciliación de existencias desde el propio escritorio de "
"ERPNext. Todo movimiento de existencias debe pasar por frappe_wms "
"(entrada/salida de mercancías, aplicación RF), que lo refleja "
"automáticamente en ERPNext. Desactívelo solo como salida temporal."

